  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British Geological Survey (ODA CDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British Geological Survey research programme aims to understand humanitarian response partner information needs during geohazard related emergencies. It will develop and test new approaches to producing evidence and science-advice related to earthquakes, volcanic eruptions and other geohazard emergencies toward providing humanitarian response actors with the information they need to enhance their preparedness and response.</narrative>
  </description>
